window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-047-626db26455b08303.json"]={sha256:"626db26455b08303e9b2ec451013aaa5932a6602c017d308a67cfe48dd1ee560",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-95d717ba7201260a","url":"https://www.opencompute.org/projects/rack-and-power/","title":"Rack and Power","titleEn":"Rack and Power","publisher":"Open Compute Project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-047","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-047","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-048","referenceUrls":["https://www.energystar.gov/products/data_center_equipment/16-more-ways-cut-energy-waste-data-center/reduce-energy-losses-uninterruptible-power-supply-ups-systems"],"title":"UPS：可用能量、轉換損失與支援時間","titleEn":"UPS: usable energy, conversion losses and support duration","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付來源路徑表、共同祖先、X 失效結果與未達條件清單；只移除模型節點；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver source paths, common ancestors, X-failure results and unmet conditions. Fault injection removes nodes only from the model and never sends commands to electrical equipment. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立 energy_kWh、usable_fraction、efficiency、load_kW 與 power_limit；先驗證負載不超功率能力，再做能量除法。","differenceEn":"Record energy, usable fraction, efficiency, load and power limit. Check the instantaneous power condition before calculating duration; enough energy cannot compensate for an output stage unable to supply the load.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["每負載至少一條完整來源路徑存活才可用；移除指定元件後，以圖可達性計算無路徑負載數；十六負載名義的兩路都依賴 UPS-X；變更後八負載改具獨立 Y 路徑，其餘八仍只依賴 X；事件為 X 失效；名義式 8+8 = 16 loads disconnected；變更式 16-8 = 8 loads disconnected。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","恆功率模型時間為名義能量*可用比例*效率/負載，單位小時後乘六十；不含放電倍率曲線與老化的額外效應；名義能量 20 kWh、可用比例 0.8、轉換效率 0.9；負載由 100 改為 120 kW；名義式 20*0.8*0.9/100*60 = 8.64 min modeled runtime；變更式 20*0.8*0.9/120*60 = 7.2 min modeled runtime。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["A load remains available only if at least one complete source path survives. Remove the specified component and use reachability to count disconnected loads, rather than counting plugs or cables. All sixteen loads initially depend on UPS-X through both apparent paths. After changing the graph, eight gain an independent path through Y while eight still depend only on X. The event removes X. Nominal 8+8 = 16 loads disconnected; changed 16-8 = 8 loads disconnected. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","In a constant-power model, duration equals nominal energy times usable fraction times efficiency divided by load, then converted from hours to minutes. Discharge-rate curves and additional aging effects are excluded. Nominal energy is 20 kWh, usable fraction 0.8 and conversion efficiency 0.9. Constant load changes from 100 to 120 kW. The values are synthetic and are not a vendor battery-runtime curve. Nominal 20*0.8*0.9/100*60 = 8.64 min modeled runtime; changed 20*0.8*0.9/120*60 = 7.2 min modeled runtime. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-057","referenceUrls":["https://docs.abinit.org/variables/basic/"],"title":"ABINIT：k 點權重、對稱縮減與能帶統計","titleEn":"ABINIT: k-point weights, symmetry reduction and band statistics","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付來源路徑表、共同祖先、X 失效結果與未達條件清單；只移除模型節點；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver source paths, common ancestors, X-failure results and unmet conditions. Fault injection removes nodes only from the model and never sends commands to electrical equipment. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"使用原創合成資料研究「ABINIT：k 點權重、對稱縮減與能帶統計」，從物理或資料契約推導計算，並以反例驗證。完成：交付不可約到完整網格映射、兩組加權結果、錯配反例與目標量限定說明。","differenceEn":"Investigate ABINIT: k-point weights, symmetry reduction and band statistics using an original synthetic fixture. Derive the calculation from its physical or data contract, challenge it with a counterexample, and defend a bounded conclusion. Complete: Deliver an irreducible-to-full-grid mapping, weighted results for both datasets, a permutation counterexample and a statement restricting the conclusion to the specified band statistic.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["每負載至少一條完整來源路徑存活才可用；移除指定元件後，以圖可達性計算無路徑負載數；十六負載名義的兩路都依賴 UPS-X；變更後八負載改具獨立 Y 路徑，其餘八仍只依賴 X；事件為 X 失效；名義式 8+8 = 16 loads disconnected；變更式 16-8 = 8 loads disconnected。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","以加權式與展開四筆值兩種方式求平均；另算未加權的兩點平均，說明它代表不同問題。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["A load remains available only if at least one complete source path survives. Remove the specified component and use reachability to count disconnected loads, rather than counting plugs or cables. All sixteen loads initially depend on UPS-X through both apparent paths. After changing the graph, eight gain an independent path through Y while eight still depend only on X. The event removes X. Nominal 8+8 = 16 loads disconnected; changed 16-8 = 8 loads disconnected. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compute the result using both weighted arithmetic and the expanded list of four values. Also calculate the unweighted two-point mean and explain why it represents a different sampling measure rather than a competing approximation to the same formula.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-5e9139e78caebdc5","url":"https://www.energystar.gov/products/data_center_equipment/16-more-ways-cut-energy-waste-data-center/reduce-energy-losses-uninterruptible-power-supply-ups-systems","title":"Reduce Energy Loss from UPS Systems","titleEn":"Reduce Energy Loss from UPS Systems","publisher":"US EPA ENERGY STAR","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-1c4e445b78e91103","url":"https://docs.abinit.org/variables/basic/","title":"ABINIT basic input variables","titleEn":"ABINIT basic input variables","publisher":"ABINIT","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
